{
  "$comment": "Context usage summary for the composer ring and the context panel (P4 U4, D-174..). Clients run their production summary function on the conversation's ledger manifests (createdAt order, latest last) plus the latest valid checkpoint, and compare every expected field exactly. Percent / tone reuse budget.v1 rule 12.",
  "schema": "oriveo.context.usage",
  "version": 1,
  "segmentGroups": {
    "instructions": [
      "skill",
      "instructions",
      "standingInstructions",
      "purposeSystem",
      "toolSafety"
    ],
    "memory": [
      "memory"
    ],
    "library": [
      "notes",
      "knowledge"
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    "No manifests -> display none (ring hidden, panel says usage appears after the first send).",
    "latest = last manifest. A checkpoint created after latest.createdAt -> unavailable / compacted_since; only B and W are reported.",
    "latest.checkpointId non-null (the request was built on a stored checkpoint) while input.checkpoint is null (no valid checkpoint now: compaction cleared or the row invalidated by deleted messages) -> unavailable / cleared_since; only B and W are reported; the panel hint is the same as no manifests (D-285, D-294). Manifests written without a checkpointId (in-memory fallback, overflow re-projection) never trigger this.",
    "input.currentB, when the key is present, replaces latest.B everywhere (B, percent, free): it is the window recomputed now with the current cap, from the same source as the send path. currentB null -> unavailable / window_unknown. Key absent (not wired, or the conversation / connection / model cannot be resolved) -> latest.B (D-285, P8 review).",
    "used = latest.observedInput when present (basis observed), else latest.estimatedInput (basis estimated). manifest.basis is ignored.",
    "omitted = per-kind sum of segment.omitted for notes / knowledge / memory.",
    "latest.B null -> unavailable / window_unknown; segments null.",
    "segments: instructions / memory / library sum segment tokens by segmentGroups; summary = checkpoint.latestSummaryTokens (estimateMessage of the checkpoint text) when a checkpoint exists, else 0; conversation = max(0, used - instructions - memory - library - summary); free = max(0, B - used).",
    "percent = ceil(100 * used / B). No manifest with observedInput ever -> unavailable / never_observed with estimatedPercent = percent (panel only).",
    "tone: error when latest.stopReason is context_window_exceeded, warm at percent >= 70, else neutral.",
    "ring: label \"!\" with tone error when tone is error or percent >= 100, else label = percent as decimal string with the same tone; null unless display is percent."
  ],
